                                "sense_id": "ac474aa1-c921-3b0a-aa13-0d9887ac4fea",
                                "text": "The proceedings of that fine old institution, the coroner's court, are apt to have their dignity impaired by the somewhat unjudicial surroundings amidst which they are conducted."
                            }
